{"seq":52,"slug":"stochastic-calculus","title":"随机微积分","stage":"DONE","category":"mathematics-statistics","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-calculus","rating":{"composite":3.9,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"随机微积分-为随机性建立微积分\">随机微积分：为随机性建立微积分</h1><p>普通微积分处理的是光滑的、可微的曲线。可一旦把股价、粒子的碰撞、神经元的电位放进坐标系，画出来的路径处处抖动、处处不可导，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dx/dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 根本不存在。随机微积分就是为这类「无处可导却处处连续」的路径重建一整套积分与求导规则的学科。它的核心洞见只有一句：布朗运动的二次变差不是零，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>W</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dW^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的量级是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 而不是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><msup><mi>t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">dt^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，于是泰勒展开必须多留一项，链式法则被改写成 Itô 公式。整个学科都是这一句话的展开。</p>\n<p>本 hub 按「基础 → 积分 → 演算 → 应用」四条递进主线组织。<strong>基础</strong>篇先讲清为什么需要新工具、布朗运动到底是什么、以及支撑一切的鞅与过滤语言；<strong>积分</strong>篇从零构造 Itô 积分，证明使它可计算的 Itô 等距，并把二次变差从直觉提升为定义；<strong>演算</strong>篇给出随机微积分的引擎——Itô 公式，用它写出并求解随机微分方程，再澄清 Itô 与 Stratonovich 两种约定的分歧；<strong>应用</strong>篇走向真实世界：Girsanov 测度变换、Black-Scholes 期权定价，以及数值方法、扩散生成模型、粗糙波动率这些 2026 年仍在演进的前沿与边界。</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工边界</strong>：随机过程 hub（<code>../23_stochastic-processes/</code>）覆盖马尔可夫链、泊松过程、平稳性等更广的过程分类，本 hub 只深挖「布朗运动驱动的连续路径微积分」这一支，两者在布朗运动与 Itô 积分处有意重叠但侧重不同——那边点到为止，这边逐步构造。测度论与勒贝格积分的严格基础属于实分析 hub（<code>../19_real-analysis-measure/</code>），本 hub 直接借用不重证。概率语言、条件期望、分布论属于概率统计 hub（<code>../02_probability-statistics/</code>）。确定性的 ODE/PDE 属于微分方程 hub（<code>../17_differential-equations/</code>），本 hub 只在 Feynman-Kac 与 Black-Scholes PDE 处与之接壤。</p>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：多元微积分与泰勒展开、线性代数、以及概率论中的随机变量、期望、方差、条件期望和正态分布。测度论不是硬门槛——遇到测度、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>-代数、几乎必然收敛时，读者只需接受其直觉，严格定义可回实分析 hub 补。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>：初学者按目录顺序线性通读，基础篇三篇不可跳过，尤其鞅与过滤是后续所有证明的脚手架。有概率论背景、只想快速理解 Itô 公式的读者，可从布朗运动直接跳到二次变差再到 Itô 公式，回头再补积分构造。金融从业者可先读应用篇的 Girsanov 与 Black-Scholes 建立动机，再倒回演算篇补齐 SDE 求解。机器学习方向的读者应重点关注 SDE、Itô 公式与应用篇末篇的扩散模型部分。</p>\n<p>读完本 hub，你不该只会背 Itô 公式，而应能在看到任何一个由噪声驱动的系统时，条件反射地问：它的漂移项是什么、扩散项是什么、二次变差贡献了哪一项修正——这正是随机建模的思维底座。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础：新工具的动机与原料","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-calculus/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-stochastic-calculus","title":"为何随机微积分：当路径处处不可导","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-calculus/foundations/why-stochastic-calculus"},{"seq":2,"slug":"brownian-motion","title":"布朗运动：随机微积分唯一的积分子","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-calculus/foundations/brownian-motion"},{"seq":3,"slug":"martingales","title":"鞅与过滤：随机微积分证明的语言","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-calculus/foundations/martingales"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"integral","title":"积分：从零构造对布朗运动的积分","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-calculus/integral","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ito-integral","title":"Itô 积分：从零构造随机积分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-calculus/integral/ito-integral"},{"seq":2,"slug":"ito-isometry","title":"Itô 等距：让随机积分可计算的引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-calculus/integral/ito-isometry"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quadratic-variation","title":"二次变差：随机微积分的数值心脏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-calculus/integral/quadratic-variation"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"calculus","title":"演算：随机世界的链式法则与方程","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-calculus/calculus","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ito-formula","title":"Itô 公式：随机世界的链式法则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-calculus/calculus/ito-formula"},{"seq":2,"slug":"sde","title":"随机微分方程：给动态系统装上噪声","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-calculus/calculus/sde"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ito-vs-stratonovich","title":"Itô 与 Stratonovich：两种约定的分歧与和解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-calculus/calculus/ito-vs-stratonovich"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"应用：从测度变换到期权定价与前沿","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-calculus/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"girsanov-change-measure","title":"Girsanov 与测度变换：给布朗运动改写漂移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-calculus/practice/girsanov-change-measure"},{"seq":2,"slug":"finance-applications","title":"金融应用：Black-Scholes 与期权定价","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-calculus/practice/finance-applications"},{"seq":3,"slug":"stochastic-calculus-in-practice","title":"应用与边界：数值方法、扩散模型与理论疆界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/stochastic-calculus/practice/stochastic-calculus-in-practice"}]}]}